    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479290/extras/a870d2f4ed2863793fd0dd01e11f9a2c.poster.avif?t=1751967281\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479290/extras/a870d2f4ed2863793fd0dd01e11f9a2c.webm?t=1751967281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479290/extras/a870d2f4ed2863793fd0dd01e11f9a2c.mp4?t=1751967281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Identify and fix problems with computers arriving for repair. Replace quality parts with crappy parts if you wish.<br>Fix broken parts and assemble them in a computer. Then put it up for sale and negotiate with customers. Fool them if you can.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479290/extras/d453962e0d557c0851a3f8a3d7c4a44a.poster.avif?t=1751967281\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479290/extras/d453962e0d557c0851a3f8a3d7c4a44a.webm?t=1751967281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479290/extras/d453962e0d557c0851a3f8a3d7c4a44a.mp4?t=1751967281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Develop viruses and infect computers with the money you earn. Join the robot wars and develop your own robot.<br><br>Hack customers computers and find out their bank details. Steal the money and leave no trace behind.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479290/extras/439f589ed2c7d136107cd5cc5fe0a688.poster.avif?t=1751967281\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it